/*
 * CEO Mandate — game content (bilingual: Indonesian `id`, English `en`).
 *
 * This file holds every number and every text in the game. Instructors can edit
 * it to add policies, cases or scenarios without touching the engine.
 *
 * Conventions
 *  - All simulation values are normalized 0..1 (0.5 = neutral).
 *  - Policy `fx` / `gx`: [targetId, coefficient]. For slider policies the effect
 *    is coefficient × intensity (0..1). For bipolar policies (pricing, wages,
 *    executive pay) it is coefficient × (2·intensity − 1).
 *  - KPI `fx` and stakeholder `inputs` are centered: coefficient × (2·value − 1).
 *  - `cost` is a share of quarterly sales volume at full intensity. Negative cost
 *    means savings, which phase in with the policy (costs hit immediately).
 *  - `speed` is how fast a policy or KPI moves toward its target each quarter.
 */
